{"seq":8,"slug":"lc0907-sum-of-subarray-minimums","title":"LeetCode 907 子数组的最小值之和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0907-sum-of-subarray-minimums","wordCount":798,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-907-子数组的最小值之和\">LeetCode 907 子数组的最小值之和</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个整数数组 <code>arr</code>，找到 <code>min(b)</code> 的总和，其中 <code>b</code> 的范围为 <code>arr</code> 的每个（连续）子数组。</p>\n<p>由于答案可能很大，返回答案对 <code>10^9 + 7</code> 取模后的结果。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= arr.length &lt;= 3 × 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= arr[i] &lt;= 3 × 10^4</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：arr = [3,1,2,4]&#10;输出：17&#10;解释：子数组为 [3], [1], [2], [4], [3,1], [1,2], [2,4], [3,1,2], [1,2,4], [3,1,2,4]&#10;最小值分别为 3, 1, 2, 4, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1，总和 = 17\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：arr = [3,1,2,4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：子数组为 [3], [1], [2], [4], [3,1], [1,2], [2,4], [3,1,2], [1,2,4], [3,1,2,4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最小值分别为 3, 1, 2, 4, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1，总和 = 17</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：arr = [11,81,94,43,3]&#10;输出：444\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：arr = [11,81,94,43,3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：444</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题将单调栈与贡献法巧妙结合。不是枚举每个子数组求最小值，而是反过来思考每个元素作为最小值的贡献。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p><strong>暴力方法</strong></p>\n<p>枚举所有子数组并求最小值，时间复杂度 O(n²) 或 O(n³)，无法通过大规模数据。</p>\n<p><strong>贡献法 + 单调栈</strong></p>\n<p>换一个角度：对于数组中的每个元素 <code>arr[i]</code>，它作为多少个子数组的最小值？如果 <code>arr[i]</code> 是 <code>count</code> 个子数组的最小值，那么它对总和的贡献就是 <code>arr[i] × count</code>。</p>\n<p>要计算 <code>count</code>，需要找到 <code>arr[i]</code> 作为最小值的&quot;管辖范围&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>左边界 <code>left[i]</code></strong>：<code>arr[i]</code> 左边第一个<strong>严格小于</strong>它的元素的位置</li>\n<li><strong>右边界 <code>right[i]</code></strong>：<code>arr[i]</code> 右边第一个<strong>小于等于</strong>它的元素的位置</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以 <code>arr[i]</code> 为最小值的子数组，其左端点可以在 <code>(left[i], i]</code> 中选择（共 <code>i - left[i]</code> 种），右端点可以在 <code>[i, right[i])</code> 中选择（共 <code>right[i] - i</code> 种）。因此：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"count = (i - left[i]) × (right[i] - i)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>count = (i - left[i]) × (right[i] - i)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>为什么左右边界条件不同（严格小于 vs 小于等于）？</strong> 这是为了避免重复计算。当存在相等元素时，如果两边都用严格小于，同一个子数组会被多个相等元素都&quot;认领&quot;为自己的贡献。一边用严格小于、一边用小于等于，确保每个子数组恰好被一个元素统计一次。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力枚举</td>\n<td>O(n²) ~ O(n³)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>简单但超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贡献法 + 单调栈</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>每个元素只计算一次贡献</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function sumSubarrayMins(arr: number[]): number {&#10;  const MOD = 1_000_000_007;&#10;  const n = arr.length;&#10;&#10;  const left = new Array(n).fill(-1);&#10;  const right = new Array(n).fill(n);&#10;&#10;  const stack: number[] = [];&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    while (stack.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; arr[stack[stack.length - 1]] &gt;= arr[i]) {&#10;      stack.pop();&#10;    }&#10;    left[i] = stack.length &gt; 0 ? stack[stack.length - 1] : -1;&#10;    stack.push(i);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  stack.length = 0;&#10;  for (let i = n - 1; i &gt;= 0; i--) {&#10;    while (stack.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; arr[stack[stack.length - 1]] &gt; arr[i]) {&#10;      stack.pop();&#10;    }&#10;    right[i] = stack.length &gt; 0 ? stack[stack.length - 1] : n;&#10;    stack.push(i);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  let result = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    const leftCount = i - left[i];&#10;    const rightCount = right[i] - i;&#10;    result = (result + arr[i] * leftCount * rightCount) % MOD;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sumSubarrayMins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MOD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1_000_000_007</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr[stack[stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr[i]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    left[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-